WEBVTT

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:32.062
Tusonge kwa ugavi na maafa huko.

00:09:32.086 --> 00:09:33.959
Haijulikani vyema

00:09:33.983 --> 00:09:39.482
ya kuwa sekta ya tumbaku
inategemea

00:09:41.394 --> 00:09:44.768
ajira kwa watoto.
Machi 2017, Shirika la Kazi Duniani

00:09:44.792 --> 00:09:47.578
lilitoa ripoti iliyosema:

00:09:47.602 --> 00:09:52.665
"Kwa jamii zinazokuwa tumbaku, 
ajira kwa watoto imeenea."

00:09:53.499 --> 00:09:54.991
Wizara ya Marekani ya Ajira,

00:09:55.015 --> 00:10:01.499
kwa sasa imeorodhesha mataifa